# Reporivet-managed repository hygiene.
# Keep examples, lockfiles, migrations, and source fixtures tracked intentionally.
# This is defense-in-depth only: rotate any secret that was ever committed.

# reporivet:start

# Reporivet runtime output
.harness/runs/*
!.harness/runs/.gitkeep
.harness/tmp/
.harness/worktrees/

